{
  "name": "Invoice Auto-Pay Guardian — 3-Way Match, Caps & Audit Trail",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ INVOICE AUTO-PAY GUARDIAN\n**What it does:** Supplier invoices arrive by email → AI does a line-by-line 3-way match (invoice vs PO vs receiving record) → ONLY exact matches within your caps are auto-paid. New suppliers, changed bank details, duplicates, mismatches or cap breaches go to a human review queue. Every step is logged with a full audit trail.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Gmail account receiving supplier invoices (OAuth2)\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n- Payment provider account with API access (Stripe / Wise / Melio) — TEST MODE first\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `RECEIVED` → `MATCHING` → `APPROVED` → `QUEUED_FOR_PAYMENT` → `PAID` / `REVIEW` / `BLOCKED` / `REJECTED`\n\n**Safety:** autopay PAUSES automatically if a duplicate payment or an unsettled payment is found in the log (kill-switch). Never auto-pay without caps.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 6400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "02aedcbc-f348-40e7-9c7f-4bd0bf7d053a",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Invoice intake\nGmail Trigger (subject:invoice + attachment) → download PDF → extract text → parse invoice number, supplier, PO number, amount, currency, due date, bank last-4.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a54a2d62-96da-42aa-a8a8-fcfbdf536b32",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Log, dedupe + kill-switch\nAppend row as `RECEIVED` → read the log → duplicate invoice? (same invoice no. + supplier already logged) or kill-switch active? (any `BLOCKED` row or `PAID` row with settlement lost) → `BLOCKED` + alert, autopay paused.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 960,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4b1d5d00-54ea-4a6d-90b3-8d369625c918",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — Supplier check\nKnown supplier on the allowlist? Bank details unchanged vs the stored record? New supplier or changed bank details → `REVIEW` queue.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a0d84f92-9ee6-4007-9473-2db7096fb529",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2160,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — 3-way match (AI)\nAI Agent compares invoice vs PO vs receiving record line by line (shorts, subs, price changes, credit memos) via Structured Output Parser.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 960,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6a5d0c0b-200b-4645-9369-b90980a8f0e0",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2880,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 5 — Caps & approval gate\nExact match AND amount ≤ per-payment cap AND daily total ≤ daily cap → `APPROVED`. Anything else → `REVIEW` queue with a Telegram approval form.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c96b1c70-b89b-47ef-a55f-3a8be8d5e8ec",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3840,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 6 — Payment + audit\nIdempotency-Key header on every payment call (retries can never pay twice) → verify settlement → sheet flips to `PAID` with payment reference + policy version → Telegram summary.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9baa9fdf-eeda-4a90-8a21-70cd1bc24407",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4560,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 7 — Review queue & alerts\n`REVIEW` items get a Telegram message with an approve/reject form. Approved → payment runs. Rejected → `REJECTED`. `BLOCKED` duplicates alert immediately.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9d22bb88-31cf-4641-95e7-43183b5762dd",
